ed Native\": frozen prototype, P09 extraction plan\n2413:3. D014 holds: secrets enter only through the host secret sheet and vault;\n2443:   C28–C34 follow D034.\n2451:## D059 — P09 re-cut: port the prototype, one gate per screen at 8\n2458:- The frozen prototype (D058, version 134) is the specification per screen; the\n2466:  the full fixture suite, the Codex review), accepted at 8 under D032/D034; the\n2477:## Directions explicitly requested before round 1\n2490:## Interview exit and remaining evidence\n2502:## D060 — No import from the alpha; this desktop is v1\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
