 | A topic changed by another writer between Review and Apply is reported as changed since review after the operator confirms, and nothing is w… | changed-since-review and edited-after-review refusals are the core's: crates/desktop-core/tests/runtime_changes |\n| C09-N04 | Deleting a topic: the sheet is destructive and Return chooses Cancel (nothing deleted); choosing Delete sends exactly one DELETE and the win… | the destructive delete sheet and its one DELETE: crates/desktop-core/tests/runtime_changes and the host's sheet tests; the v2 board exercises the update path natively (C39-N02) |\n| C09-N05 | Creating an API key: the deployment profile's auth code is added by the desktop (the POST carries the profile's code and the client as autho… | API key creation with the profile's auth code: crates/desktop-core/tests/runtime_changes (the code never leaves the core) |\n| C09-N06 | Show new key… opens a native sheet showing the issued key (hash-equal to what the service issued); Copy and Close puts it on the general cli… | the one-time key sheet and the concealed clipboard: the host's secret-sheet tests (apps/desktop/src-tauri/tests) and crates/desktop-core/tests/runtime_changes |\n| C09-N07 | Rotating a key: the rotation sheet is destructive (Return cancels; Rotate key applies); Clear key forgets a held key and the window says so;… | key rotation and Clear key: crates/desktop-core/tests/runtime_changes |\n| C09-N08 | T23: with the management endpoint stopped, a confirmed create (it needs no baseline read) reports that the service could not be reached and … | a confirmed create with the plane stopped reports an unknown outcome: crates/desktop-core/tests/runtime_changes (transport failure) |\n| C09-N09 | Quitting while a confirmed create is in flight and relaunching: no change review or result is shown and nothing is sent again within 6 s of … | no replay after a relaunch mid-flight: crates/desktop-core/tests/runtime_changes |\n| C09-N11 | Retiring the context ends open 