{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_72","type":"agent_message","text":"{\n  \"request_id\": \"C31-attempt-05-1793619521\",\n  \"attempt_id\": \"attempt-05\",\n  \"subject\": \"C31\",\n  \"fingerprints\": {\n    \"source\": \"bb2b1d2e79472c3fe2394f5298fe0b33eb8ff4197e2b909d52f92e6c027be35f\",\n    \"dependencies\": \"f5f26271b8823df8a2b5299417146784d345d4e04f8b59341706e6a41750210d\",\n    \"build_flags\": \"166488b352224eb230ddfca178064d76f43deecbb6c73fb6d9359f56632e1a1f\",\n    \"evidence\": \"20ced4524fae643c13c11b29f8924c0b733b1505855924493a289a50de8962e2\"\n  },\n  \"scores\": {\n    \"architecture\": 9,\n    \"behavior\": 8,\n    \"authority_security\": 8,\n    \"validation\": 8,\n    \"overall\": 8\n  },\n  \"required_fixes\": [\n    \"R1 — apps/desktop/src-tauri/src/lib.rs:132 and :248; apps/desktop/src/v2/admin/review-sheet.tsx:128; crates/desktop-core/src/authority.rs:3453: renderer reload does not retire the departed page's review or disclosure ownership. ReviewSheet relies on React cleanup followed by a window timer to send DiscardChange/ForgetSecret; document destruction does not guarantee either runs. The native PageLoadEvent::Started handler only retires observations, and registering the replacement delivery session only changes delivery bookkeeping. Consequently, an unrevealed issued key remains Held and revealable after its review disappeared; a pending native confirmation also retains its valid review. This violates I6's review-exit lifetime and the native editor-lease contract. Acceptance: native page teardown must invalidate its pending reviews/confirmations, dismiss disclosure, forget held keys and mark unsettled issuances forgotten-on-settle while preserving remote outcomes. Production-interface host regressions must exercise reload before reveal, during confirmation and during delayed issuance; the replacement page must receive no surviving disclosure authority, stale confirmation must apply nothing, and no mutation may be replayed.\",\n